1
00:00:23,776 --> 00:00:28,515
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,515 --> 00:00:32,227
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,451 --> 00:00:34,696
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,043 --> 00:00:37,750
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,629 --> 00:00:43,157
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,157 --> 00:00:46,789
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,267 --> 00:00:50,755
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,899 --> 00:00:55,395
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,395 --> 00:01:00,035
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,423 --> 00:01:02,083
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,083 --> 00:01:08,035
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,227 --> 00:01:11,915
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,915 --> 00:01:15,486
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,651 --> 00:01:22,595
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,043 --> 00:01:26,664
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,664 --> 00:01:30,348
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,435 --> 00:01:35,363
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,363 --> 00:01:39,523
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,267 --> 00:01:46,819
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,363 --> 00:01:50,019
=Episode 16=

21
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:55,776
(Ghost)

22
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,519
Governor,

23
00:02:04,519 --> 00:02:05,959
our people have sent words.

24
00:02:05,959 --> 00:02:09,319
Jiang Chun'er replaced Song Mianxiang,
President Jiang's real killer,

25
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:10,639
and is being held in prison.

26
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:13,080
Xu You'an is unaware of that now.

27
00:02:14,159 --> 00:02:15,960
Heaven is helping us!

28
00:02:16,919 --> 00:02:17,719
Just go

29
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:24,400
and make sure Jiang Chun'er dies
on the execution ground tomorrow.

30
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:25,479
Yes.

31
00:02:33,439 --> 00:02:35,039
(My Jiang family has wronged you all.)

32
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,840
(So let me die in your stead.)

33
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,680
(Once Death claims this debt of sin,)

34
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:43,400
(I hope you can forgive my family.)

35
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:46,800
Song Mianxiang.

36
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,639
Execute her!

37
00:02:57,759 --> 00:03:00,159
Kill her!

38
00:03:00,919 --> 00:03:03,319
Kill her!

39
00:03:11,039 --> 00:03:13,439
(Her Death is Fengcheng's Peace)
Kill her!

40
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:17,280
Kill her!

41
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,400
Adjutant Sun, what's going on?

42
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:22,439
Didn't we already
reveal the truth to the public?

43
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,080
Why do they
still hate Song Mianxiang so much?

44
00:03:25,759 --> 00:03:28,479
They only saw the knife she raised,

45
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:32,319
but didn't see that beneath her knife

46
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:34,439
were blood-soaked monsters
disguised as men.

47
00:03:35,479 --> 00:03:41,680
Because the clamor of the opera
had dressed them up as respectable folk.

48
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:51,159
Execute her!

49
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:53,000
Kill her!

50
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:59,479
Kill her!

51
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:06,000
Kill her!

52
00:04:09,879 --> 00:04:10,680
Miss Jiang?

53
00:04:10,879 --> 00:04:11,680
Chun'er?

54
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,199
Stop!

55
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:37,360
Dr. Song!

56
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,480
Dr. Song!

57
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,360
Are you alright?

58
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:55,079
I lay out the indictment with my life

59
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,680
and write their sins in blood,

60
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:02,114
only hoping to bring the truth
of that unjust case

61
00:05:02,114 --> 00:05:03,639
from eight years ago to light.

62
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,560
I killed Jiang Xiaoren.

63
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:12,879
But his death

64
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:20,079
is far from enough to repay the debt
of over 60 lives from eight years ago.

65
00:05:27,959 --> 00:05:29,759
So this is the blood indictment
she spoke of?

66
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,600
Those are names of over 60 people.

67
00:05:33,399 --> 00:05:34,079
Oh, my!

68
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,240
That's so pitiful!

69
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:39,279
I was abducted and taken
to the Jiang family when I was fifteen.

70
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:45,759
The other abducted girls and I

71
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:52,519
were just living toys to Jiang Xiaoren

72
00:05:53,279 --> 00:05:54,600
for others' amusement

73
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,319
in exchange for profits.

74
00:05:59,399 --> 00:06:01,720
Jiang Xiaoren committed such evil deeds

75
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:07,000
only because he had the backing
of Xu Fan and the Xiaosheng Society.

76
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:08,839
They protected each other,

77
00:06:08,839 --> 00:06:10,040
colluding in villainy.

78
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:13,000
They feared the truth would be exposed,

79
00:06:13,399 --> 00:06:15,600
so they cruelly killed everyone

80
00:06:17,639 --> 00:06:20,279
and framed Zhao Shengge

81
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:22,720
as the murderer in the serial killings
eight years ago,

82
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:28,000
burying both the truth
and the injustice.

83
00:07:11,279 --> 00:07:12,240
Who fired the shot?

84
00:07:13,199 --> 00:07:13,839
What happened?

85
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:14,920
Dr. Song?

86
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,040
Dr. Song!

87
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:25,759
I saw it! Someone
from the Xiaosheng Society fired!

88
00:07:26,399 --> 00:07:27,199
Adjutant Sun,

89
00:07:27,319 --> 00:07:28,519
have this place surrounded.

90
00:07:28,519 --> 00:07:29,019
Yes.

91
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,720
Dr. Song.

92
00:07:33,199 --> 00:07:34,000
Dr. Song.

93
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:40,879
My name is Yu Xiangling.

94
00:07:43,199 --> 00:07:45,759
I was born into a family of doctors,

95
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,480
not a commodity.

96
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:52,680
I know.

97
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,839
I'm an innocent person.

98
00:08:03,439 --> 00:08:04,240
Dr. Song!

99
00:08:04,639 --> 00:08:05,439
Dr. Song!

100
00:08:06,759 --> 00:08:07,680
Dr. Song!

101
00:09:00,919 --> 00:09:01,639
Fengqiu,

102
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:02,879
think of your daughter.

103
00:09:02,879 --> 00:09:03,960
She is still so young.

104
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,240
She can't be without her mother.

105
00:09:06,340 --> 00:09:07,320
- Chun'er.
- Fengqiu.

106
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:10,759
Take this, and leave
with this gentleman.

107
00:09:10,919 --> 00:09:11,720
Mother.

108
00:09:12,919 --> 00:09:13,799
We go together.

109
00:09:13,879 --> 00:09:15,399
Senior, you go first.

110
00:09:15,519 --> 00:09:17,240
Jiang Xiaoren abducted dozens of women,

111
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:19,159
trading them like commodities.

112
00:09:19,159 --> 00:09:21,240
I must go save them
and take them with me.

113
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,200
Go quickly!

114
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,000
Fengqiu!

115
00:09:24,039 --> 00:09:24,679
Senior,

116
00:09:24,679 --> 00:09:25,240
go quickly.

117
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:25,960
No,

118
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,759
Fengqiu!

119
00:09:27,039 --> 00:09:28,600
You know too much.

120
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,519
Where do you think you're going?

121
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:32,960
Fengqiu,

122
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,440
hurry and go!

123
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:35,600
- Senior!
- Take Chun'er and go!

124
00:09:36,279 --> 00:09:37,080
Go!

125
00:09:37,279 --> 00:09:38,480
Catch her.

126
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:39,279
Yes!

127
00:09:42,139 --> 00:09:42,639
After them!

128
00:09:42,639 --> 00:09:43,139
Hurry!

129
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:44,960
This way! Hurry!

130
00:09:45,559 --> 00:09:46,639
Mother, I'm scared.

131
00:09:46,639 --> 00:09:47,600
Don't be scared.

132
00:09:47,639 --> 00:09:48,480
I'm here.

133
00:09:50,519 --> 00:09:51,320
Let's go.

134
00:10:09,919 --> 00:10:10,519
Let's go.

135
00:10:13,799 --> 00:10:15,440
Mother, I'm scared.

136
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,840
Don't be scared. Let's go.

137
00:10:33,152 --> 00:10:34,240
(Account Book)

138
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:40,960
Come on.

139
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,679
Go inside.

140
00:10:45,039 --> 00:10:45,759
Mother!

141
00:10:46,759 --> 00:10:48,080
Let go of my mother!

142
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,320
Let go of my mother!

143
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,159
Get away!

144
00:10:51,039 --> 00:10:52,440
Don't touch my child!

145
00:10:54,039 --> 00:10:55,399
Let go of my mother!

146
00:10:56,639 --> 00:10:57,440
Get away!

147
00:11:56,672 --> 00:11:57,440
(Woman's Plea at Paramount
Reveals the True Culprit)

148
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,240
President Jiang,

149
00:11:58,600 --> 00:11:59,720
as you instructed,

150
00:11:59,919 --> 00:12:04,559
tomorrow's headline
in the Fengcheng Daily will be this.

151
00:12:06,799 --> 00:12:07,600
President Jiang,

152
00:12:07,639 --> 00:12:09,919
Paramount has been closed down
as you ordered

153
00:12:09,919 --> 00:12:11,559
and will become a modern girls' school.

154
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:18,039
Let's call it Fengxiang Girls' School.

155
00:12:18,879 --> 00:12:20,759
All girls can study there

156
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:23,120
to create a different future
for themselves.

157
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:27,399
President,

158
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,600
all our shops have been ransacked.

159
00:12:29,919 --> 00:12:31,559
And some members have left the society.

160
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:33,679
The situation is dire.

161
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:40,000
You let a rabble of fools rattle you?

162
00:12:40,039 --> 00:12:44,000
How dare a bunch of scoundrels
raise their flags here?

163
00:12:47,399 --> 00:12:48,200
Xu You'an,

164
00:12:49,159 --> 00:12:51,320
how dare you trespass
into the Xiaosheng Society!

165
00:12:51,879 --> 00:12:52,720
Trespass?

166
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:55,759
Governor Mansion rules
the whole Fengcheng.

167
00:12:56,399 --> 00:12:58,399
You greedy, heartless,

168
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,679
women-abducting,

169
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:03,159
and murderous beasts!

170
00:13:04,039 --> 00:13:07,840
Now that the truth is out,
you're still acting tough?

171
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:08,919
Nonsense!

172
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:12,480
This is solid proof of your vile deeds.

173
00:13:12,639 --> 00:13:13,559
Still denying it?

174
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:26,519
You keep a pack of dogs,
and you dare to strut around here?

175
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:32,399
A brat born of a dancing girl,

176
00:13:33,159 --> 00:13:35,600
and you really think
you're the Governor?

177
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:44,159
Say that again!

178
00:13:47,639 --> 00:13:48,960
If you dare to strike,

179
00:13:49,639 --> 00:13:53,440
I'll make all the people of Fengcheng
die with me.

180
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:57,759
Xu You'an!

181
00:14:04,639 --> 00:14:07,679
If they are not eradicated,
only the commoners will suffer.

182
00:14:08,399 --> 00:14:10,960
For now, it's better not to act rashly.

183
00:14:40,735 --> 00:14:42,015
♪As if it were fate♪

184
00:14:42,015 --> 00:14:43,372
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

185
00:14:43,934 --> 00:14:47,171
♪We miss each other♪

186
00:14:48,415 --> 00:14:49,983
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

187
00:14:49,983 --> 00:14:52,383
♪And a bizarre♪

188
00:14:52,383 --> 00:14:55,185
♪Anonymous legend♪

189
00:14:55,715 --> 00:14:57,727
♪The plot twists and turns♪

190
00:14:57,875 --> 00:14:59,615
♪Play out over and over again♪

191
00:14:59,615 --> 00:15:02,679
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

192
00:15:03,260 --> 00:15:04,959
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

193
00:15:04,959 --> 00:15:05,951
♪Refuse to submit♪

194
00:15:05,951 --> 00:15:09,151
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

195
00:15:10,815 --> 00:15:13,727
♪There are always too many♪

196
00:15:13,727 --> 00:15:15,615
♪Helpless situations♪

197
00:15:15,615 --> 00:15:18,239
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

198
00:15:19,370 --> 00:15:21,330
♪Even if I have questions♪

199
00:15:21,330 --> 00:15:23,330
♪I harbor desires♪

200
00:15:23,330 --> 00:15:26,207
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

201
00:15:26,558 --> 00:15:28,191
♪People come and go♪

202
00:15:28,191 --> 00:15:31,007
♪I'm still all alone♪

203
00:15:31,007 --> 00:15:33,735
♪Wandering around♪

204
00:15:33,983 --> 00:15:36,836
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

205
00:15:36,836 --> 00:15:41,297
♪Go through the entanglement♪

206
00:15:41,663 --> 00:15:43,391
♪If longing♪

207
00:15:43,391 --> 00:15:46,550
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

208
00:15:46,550 --> 00:15:49,305
♪How can I be at ease♪

209
00:15:49,407 --> 00:15:51,721
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

210
00:15:51,839 --> 00:15:53,695
♪And travelled around the world♪

211
00:15:53,791 --> 00:15:56,879
♪Scars all over me♪

212
00:15:57,151 --> 00:16:00,063
♪If longing never fades♪

213
00:16:00,063 --> 00:16:01,512
♪Burns still hot♪

214
00:16:01,512 --> 00:16:04,591
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

215
00:16:04,863 --> 00:16:06,720
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

216
00:16:06,783 --> 00:16:07,967
♪In the next life♪

217
00:16:07,967 --> 00:16:12,447
♪Entangle with you again♪
